<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="zh-CN"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://zhangzhenyao.com/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://zhangzhenyao.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="zh-CN"/><updated>2026-10-13T15:50:45+00:00</updated><id>https://zhangzhenyao.com/feed.xml</id><title type="html">张振尧</title><subtitle>张振尧，具身智能全栈工程师、机器人开发者生态布道者。NVIDIA Hackathon 年度总决赛冠军。 </subtitle><entry><title type="html">戴着护士帽的陪诊机器狗聆灵</title><link href="https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15022760299331982008/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="戴着护士帽的陪诊机器狗聆灵"/><published>2026-10-01T19:03:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-01T19:03:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15022760299331982008</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15022760299331982008/"><![CDATA[<p>刚刚落幕的 SheNicest 千人黑客松现场，有一台装扮格外特殊的机器狗，吸引了很多目光。它戴着一顶手工折叠的红十字护士帽，叫“聆灵”。</p> <p>聆灵是跨界团队“找零零”基于维他动力 Vbot EDU 开发版打造的 AI 医院陪诊机器狗，在这次大赛中拿到了“维他动力创造奖”。</p>]]></content><author><name>张振尧</name></author><category term="具身智能真机闭环"/><category term="机器狗"/><category term="黑客松"/><category term="创业经营"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[刚刚落幕的 SheNicest 千人黑客松现场，有一台装扮格外特殊的机器狗，吸引了很多目光]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">西湖游船上的开发者访谈，恭喜找零零队</title><link href="https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15021402007889384111/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="西湖游船上的开发者访谈，恭喜找零零队"/><published>2026-09-29T22:04:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-29T22:04:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15021402007889384111</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15021402007889384111/"><![CDATA[<p><em>地点：杭州市 · 西湖游船</em></p> <p>在杭州的开发者访谈结束了。</p> <p>恭喜“找零零队”LinBot 具身医疗陪诊团队。</p> <div class="row g-2 my-3"> <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><a href="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-0.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-0.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded border" loading="lazy" alt="2026-09-29 现场记录"/></a></div> <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><a href="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-1.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-1.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded border" loading="lazy" alt="2026-09-29 现场记录"/></a></div> <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><a href="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-2.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-2.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded border" loading="lazy" alt="2026-09-29 现场记录"/></a></div> <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><a href="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-3.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/assets/proof/002-2025-robot_15021402007889384111-3.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded border" loading="lazy" alt="2026-09-29 现场记录"/></a></div> </div>]]></content><author><name>张振尧</name></author><category term="具身智能真机闭环"/><category term="具身智能"/><category term="创业经营"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[在杭州的开发者访谈结束了]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">南京影石影像挑战赛，2 人 2 天 2 等奖</title><link href="https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15017763320079127217/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="南京影石影像挑战赛，2 人 2 天 2 等奖"/><published>2026-09-24T21:34:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-24T21:34:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15017763320079127217</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhangzhenyao.com/blog/2026/log-15017763320079127217/"><![CDATA[<p><em>地点：南京市 · Club Med地中海白日方舟·南京仙林度假村</em></p> <p>南京影石影像挑战赛：2 个人，2 天，2 等奖，2 份黄金证书。</p> <p>感谢影石，感谢刘靖康的收尾点评。中秋快乐。</p> <div class="row g-2 my-3"> <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><a href="/assets/proof/012-2026-award_15017763320079127217-0.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/asse